        "title": "Get advice",
        "text": "Contact your doctor or a vaccination clinic for good vaccination guidance."
      },
      "team": {
        "title": "About the clinic",
        "text": "Our team consists of doctors and clinic staff who want to provide a good experience, even in difficult situations."
      },
      "facility": {
        "title": "Facilities",
